CHEAP HINT#6

BEING MULTICLASS CAN BE A HELP OR A HASSLE. YOUR EXPERIENCE IS DIVIDED
BY THE AMOUNT OF CLASSES YOU HAVE CHOSEN.

A LOT OF DUNGEONS, CASTLES, TEMPLES, TOWERS, FORTS, ETC. HAVE AREAS
WHERE SPECIFIC ENCOUNTERS ARE STANDING AND WAITING. AFTER DEFEATING
ONE OF THESE IT IS BEST TO SEARCH THE AREA FOR TREASURE WHICH MIGHT
BE HIDDEN IN THE ROOM.

A COUPLE OF GOOD SPELLS AND SCROLLS TO TAKE ON ADVENTURING ARE THE
"FLY" AND "SHORT TUNNEL". THE HIGHER YOUR LEVEL THE LONGER EACH SPELL
WILL LAST BUT THE SHORT TUNNEL IS REALLY SHORT SO MAKE SURE YOU ARE
NEAR A WALL WHEN YOU CAST IT. FLYING ONLY WORKS OUTSIDE AND IS GOOD
FOR GETTING YOU OVER MOUNTAINS AND RIVERS.

STOCKING UP ON "HEAL POTIONS" IS A MARVELOUS IDEA BECAUSE SOME PLACES
YOU TRAVEL WILL BE VERY FAR FROM THE CITY STATE AND THE HEALER THERE.
AS YOU GAIN LEVELS IT IS TOUGHER TO RUN FROM MONSTERS.